    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AIR\nCALIFORNIA\n737s\nFlight Schedule\nEffective May 1, 1974\nNow Serving ... SACRAMENTO •\nSAN FRANCISCO • OAKLAND •\nSAN JOSE • PALM SPRINGS • ONTARIO •\nORANGE COUNTY • SAN DIEGO",
      "449\n429\n411\n425\n427/725\n449/761\n429/727\n411/715\n441/751\n425/727\n703\n725\n761\n703\n715\n429/727\n761\n703\n715\n711\n425/727\n761\nNo. Stops\nPALM SPRINGS to SAN JOSE\nMonday thru Thursday\n4:45P\n6:15P\nFriday\n12:25P\n1:55P\nSaturday\n9:15A\n10:40A\nSunday\n12:10P\n1:35P\nPALM SPRINGS to SACRAMENTO\nMonday thru Thursday\n12:20P\n3:30P\nVia SNA\n4:45P\n7:30P\nVia ONT\nFriday\n12:25P\n3:30P\nVia SJC\nSaturday\n9:15A\n2:20P\n1:30P\n6:30P\nVia ONT\nVia SNA\nSunday\n12:10P\n3:30P\nVia SJC\nONTARIO to SACRAMENTO\nMonday thru Thursday\n7:30A\n9:05A\n1:30P\n3:30P\n6:00P\n7:30P\nFriday\n7:30A\n11:30A\n1:00P\n6:00P\n9:05A\n1:30P\n3:30P\nVia SJC\n7:30P\nSaturday\n7:30A\n11:30A\n9:05A\n1:30P\nSunday\n9:45A\n12:40P\n6:00P\n11:15A\n3:30P\n7:30P\nVia SiC\n$29.50\n$30.00\n$24.25\n436\n422\n404\n416\nArrive\nSAN JOSE to PALM SPRINGS\nMonday thru Thursday\n3:00P\n4:25P\nFriday\n12:00N\n1:25P\nSaturday\n7:25A\n8:50A\nSunday\n10:25A\n11:50A\nNo. Stops\n714/414\n728/436\n714/414\n714/426\nSACRAMENTO to PALM SPRINGS\nMonday thru Thursday\n9:30A\n12:30P\n11:40A\n4:25P\nVia SNA\nVia SJC\nFriday\n9:30A\n11:40A\nVia SNA\nSaturday\n9:30A\n1:40P\nVia SNA\n740/450\n4:00P\nSunday\n6:40P\nVia SNA\n714\n740\n768\n714\n732/540\n740\n8768\n714\n760\n740\n766\nSACRAMENTO to ONTARIO\nMonday thru Thursday\n9:30A\n11:00A\n4:00P\n5:30P\n1\n8:00P\n9:55P\nFriday\n9:30A\n2:00P\n4:00P\n8:00P\n11:00A\n4:35P\n5:30P\nVia SJC\n9:30P\nSaturday\n9:30A\n7:00P\n11:00A\n8:55P\nSunday\n4:00P\n8:00P\n5:30P\n9:30P\nTicket Office Locations\n• Disneyland Hotel, 1441 S. West St.,\nAnaheim, California 92802\n• 505 L Street, Sacramento, California 95814\n• 460 Post St., San Francisco, California 94102\n427/622\n441/636\nPALM SPRINGS to SAN DIEGO\nMonday thru Thursday\n12:20P\n1:35P\nVia SNA\nFriday\n2:20P\n4:30P\nVia SNA\nSaturday\n$21,50\nSunday\n611/717\n623/725\n615/715\n351/761\n615/715\n637/751\n623/727\n649/761\nSAN DIEGO to SACRAMENTO\nMonday thru Thursday\n9:00A\n12:00N\n11:50A\n3:30P\nVia SJC\nVi